ExternalsLoadingPlugin.example.0.text:
```js
// webpack.config.js
import { ExternalsLoadingPlugin } from '@lynx-js/externals-loading-webpack-plugin';

export default {
  plugins: [
    new ExternalsLoadingPlugin({
      mainThreadLayer: 'main-thread',
      backgroundLayer: 'background',
      mainThreadChunks: ['index__main-thread'],
      backgroundChunks: ['index'],
      externals: {
       'lodash': {
         url: 'http://lodash.lynx.bundle',
         async: true,
         background: {
           sectionPath: 'background',
         },
         mainThread: {
           sectionPath: 'mainThread',
         },
       },
      }
    })
  ]
}
```

ExternalsLoadingPluginOptions.externals..text:
在后台 layer 和 `main-thread` layer 中加载 `lodash` 库。

```js
module.exports = {
 plugins: [
   new ExternalsLoadingPlugin({
     externals: {
       lodash: {
         url: 'http://lodash.lynx.bundle',
         background: { sectionPath: 'background' },
         mainThread: { sectionPath: 'mainThread' },
       },
     },
   }),
 ],
};
```

仅在后台 layer 中加载 `lodash` 库。

```js
module.exports = {
 plugins: [
   new ExternalsLoadingPlugin({
     externals: {
       lodash: {
         url: 'http://lodash.lynx.bundle',
         background: { sectionPath: 'background' }
       },
     },
   }),
 ],
};
```

ExternalValue.libraryName.summary.text:
库的名称。与 https://webpack.js.org/configuration/externals/#string 相同。

默认情况下，库名称与 externals 的 key 相同。例如：

配置

```js
ExternalsLoadingPlugin({
  externals: {
    lodash: {
      url: '……',
    }
  }
})
```

会生成如下 webpack externals 配置：

```js
externals: {
  lodash: 'lynx[Symbol.for("__LYNX_EXTERNAL_GLOBAL__")].lodash',
}
```

如果一个外部 bundle 包含多个模块，应设置相同的库名称，以确保只加载一次。例如：

```js
ExternalsLoadingPlugin({
  externals: {
    lodash: {
      libraryName: 'Lodash',
      url: '……',
    },
    'lodash-es': {
      libraryName: 'Lodash',
      url: '……',
    }
  }
})
```

会生成如下 webpack externals 配置：

```js
externals: {
  lodash: 'lynx[Symbol.for("__LYNX_EXTERNAL_GLOBAL__")].Lodash',
  'lodash-es': 'lynx[Symbol.for("__LYNX_EXTERNAL_GLOBAL__")].Lodash',
}
```

可以传入数组来指定 external 的子路径。与 https://webpack.js.org/configuration/externals/#string-1 相同。例如：

```js
ExternalsLoadingPlugin({
  externals: {
    preact: {
      libraryName: ['ReactLynx', 'Preact'],
      url: '……',
    },
  }
})
```

会生成如下 webpack externals 配置：

```js
externals: {
  preact: 'lynx[Symbol.for("__LYNX_EXTERNAL_GLOBAL__")].ReactLynx.Preact',
}
```
